/* ---- Efekt kütüphanesi (kullanıcının gönderdiği 10 efektlik sayfa; her biri 12 kare: oluşma 0-2 · tepe 3-5 · etki 6-8 · sönme 9-11).
   Görüntüler ancak kullanıldıkları ilk anda çözülür (Android belleği için). ---- */
var AF285_FXLIB=Object.create(null);
AF285_FXLIB.fx_dome12={meta:{"cols": 3, "rows": 4, "fw": 100, "fh": 124, "ground": 0.9354838709677419, "center": 0.5},src:'data:image/webp;base64,',img:null};
AF285_FXLIB.fx_storm_bind={meta:{"cols": 3, "rows": 4, "fw": 100, "fh": 124, "ground": 0.9354838709677419, "center": 0.5},src:'data:image/webp;base64,',img:null};
AF285_FXLIB.fx_earth_burst={meta:{"cols": 3, "rows": 4, "fw": 100, "fh": 124, "ground": 0.9354838709677419, "center": 0.5},src:'data:image/webp;base64,',img:null};
AF285_FXLIB.fx_holy_light={meta:{"cols": 3, "rows": 4, "fw": 100, "fh": 124, "ground": 0.9354838709677419, "center": 0.5},src:'data:image/webp;base64,',img:null};
AF285_FXLIB.fx_poison_flask={meta:{"cols": 3, "rows": 4, "fw": 100, "fh": 124, "ground": 0.9354838709677419, "center": 0.5},src:'data:image/webp;base64,',img:null};
AF285_FXLIB.fx_fire_shield={meta:{"cols": 3, "rows": 4, "fw": 100, "fh": 124, "ground": 0.9354838709677419, "center": 0.5},src:'data:image/webp;base64,',img:null};
AF285_FXLIB.fx_ice_slash={meta:{"cols": 3, "rows": 4, "fw": 100, "fh": 124, "ground": 0.9354838709677419, "center": 0.5},src:'data:image/webp;base64,',img:null};
AF285_FXLIB.fx_shadow_strike={meta:{"cols": 3, "rows": 4, "fw": 100, "fh": 124, "ground": 0.9354838709677419, "center": 0.5},src:'data:image/webp;base64,',img:null};
AF285_FXLIB.fx_chains={meta:{"cols": 3, "rows": 4, "fw": 100, "fh": 124, "ground": 0.9354838709677419, "center": 0.5},src:'data:image/webp;base64,',img:null};
AF285_FXLIB.fx_vines12={meta:{"cols": 3, "rows": 4, "fw": 100, "fh": 124, "ground": 0.9354838709677419, "center": 0.5},src:'data:image/webp;base64,',img:null};
function af285FxImg(name){
  const e=AF285_FXLIB[name];if(!e)return null;
  if(!e.img){e.img=new Image();e.img.decoding='async';e.img.src=e.src;}
  return e.img.complete&&e.img.naturalWidth?e.img:null;
}
/* Kütüphane karesini ayak noktasına (x,y) çizer. h: piksel yükseklik, flip: yatay ayna, sx: yatay ölçek. */
function af285FxFrame(name,frame,x,y,h,alpha,flip,sx){
  const e=AF285_FXLIB[name],im=af285FxImg(name);if(!e||!im)return false;
  const M=e.meta,n=M.cols*M.rows,f=Math.max(0,Math.min(n-1,frame|0)),w=h*M.fw/M.fh*(sx||1);
  ctx.save();ctx.globalAlpha*=alpha==null?1:alpha;ctx.translate(x,y);if(flip)ctx.scale(-1,1);
  ctx.drawImage(im,(f%M.cols)*M.fw,Math.floor(f/M.cols)*M.fh,M.fw,M.fh,-w*M.center,-h*M.ground,w,h);
  ctx.restore();return true;
}
/* Genel kütüphane efekti (çevrim içinde de aynalanır): f.a = kütüphane sırası + ölçek kesri, f.b = başlangıç karesi*100 + bitiş karesi. */
var AF285_LIBKEYS=Object.keys(AF285_FXLIB);
function af285LibEmit(u,name,x,lane,life,from,to,scale){
  const i=AF285_LIBKEYS.indexOf(name);if(i<0)return null;
  const sc=Math.max(.5,Math.min(4.4,scale||1.5));
  return af285Emit('lib',u,{x0:x,lane:lane==null?u.lane:lane,life,a:i+(sc-.5)/4,b:(from|0)*100+(to|0)});
}
AF285_VFX.lib=function(f,p){
  const idx=Math.floor(f.a),name=AF285_LIBKEYS[idx];if(!name)return;
  const sc=.5+(f.a-idx)*4,c=af285At(f.lane,f.x0),from=Math.floor(f.b/100),to=f.b%100;
  const frame=from+Math.min(to-from,Math.floor(p*(to-from+1)));
  const t=units.find(v=>v&&v.lane===f.lane&&Math.abs(v.x-f.x0)<.012&&v.hp>0);
  const pos=t?af285Pos(t):c;
  af285FxFrame(name,frame,pos.x,pos.y+2,(pos.px||c.px)*sc,1,f.team==='enemy');
};

